 "description": "Run a raw SoQL query against any Dallas open-data resource (www.dallasopendata.com) by its Socrata id (8-char like \"qv6i-rri7\"). Full SoQL: where/select/group/order/limit/offset. Use dallas_datasets to find a resource id, or dallas_recent for the common ones.",
